TOKEN tinybird_read_public READ
TOKEN tinybird_read READ

DESCRIPTION >
Discovery reliability: the latest 50 eligible final requests per model within
seven days. Fallback rescues are successes for the requested model. Caller 4xx
are excluded; owner requests and monitor probes are included.
Reads hourly aggregate state, so a call merges at most 168 rows per model.

NODE endpoint
SQL >
    SELECT
        model,
        event_type,
        1 AS is_rollup,
        arrayCount(row -> row.3 >= 200 AND row.3 < 300, recent) AS status_2xx,
        arrayCount(row -> row.3 >= 500, recent) AS errors_5xx
    FROM (
        SELECT model, event_type, groupArraySortedMerge(50)(recent) AS recent
        FROM model_health_hourly
        WHERE hour >= toStartOfHour(now() - INTERVAL 7 DAY)
            AND startsWith(model, 'community/')
        GROUP BY model, event_type
    )

TYPE endpoint
